[{"text":"CartesianPropagatorDenominator[propSq + ..., propEik + ..., m^2, {n, s}] encodes a generic Cartesian propagator denominator of the form \\frac{1}{[(q1+...)^2 + q1.p1 + ... + m^2 + s*I \\eta]^n}","anchor":"cartesianpropagatordenominator"},{"text":"propSq should be of the form CartesianMomentum[q1, D - 1], while propEik should look like CartesianPair[CartesianMomentum[q1, D - 1], CartesianMomentum[p1, D - 1].","anchor":"cartesianpropagatordenominator"},{"text":"CartesianPropagatorDenominator is an internal object. To enter such propagators in FeynCalc you should use CFAD.","anchor":"cartesianpropagatordenominator"},{"text":"Overview, CFAD, FeynAmpDenominator.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"Standard \\(3\\)-dimensional Cartesian propagator","anchor":"examples","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FeynAmpDenominator[CartesianPropagatorDenominator[CartesianMomentum[p, D - 1], 0, m^2, {1, -1}]]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{(p^2+m^2-i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Here we switch the sign of the mass term","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FeynAmpDenominator[CartesianPropagatorDenominator[CartesianMomentum[p, D - 1], 0, -m^2, {1, -1}]]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{(p^2-m^2-i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"And here also the sign of \\(i \\eta\\)","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FeynAmpDenominator[CartesianPropagatorDenominator[CartesianMomentum[p, D - 1], 0, -m^2, {1, +1}]]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{(p^2-m^2+i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Eikonal Cartesian propagator with a residual mass term","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FeynAmpDenominator[CartesianPropagatorDenominator[0, CartesianPair[CartesianMomentum[p, D - 1], CartesianMomentum[q, D - 1]], m^2, {1, -1}]]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{(p\\cdot q+m^2-i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb4-2","section":"Examples"}]